      "claim_id": "C2",
      "text": "The Services sales category experienced a 13.51% (calculated) increase in net sales, rising from $96,169 million in fiscal year 2024 to $109,158 million in fiscal year 2025; the filing reports a rounded 13% increase (Item 7, EP_0001_E01). This growth was primarily driven by higher net sales from advertising, PRODUCT_07, and cloud services (Item 7, EP_0001_E02).",
